{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897080/extras/0f43fcec1afbd9f04251680a0fea3f7d.avif?t=1771615537\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897080/extras_big/0f43fcec1afbd9f04251680a0fea3f7d.webp?t=1771615537 width=1560 height=1560 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dimenshot is a boomer shooter FPS experience that tests your reflexes and decision-making speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">It is a <strong>MELEE-FOCUSED</strong> arcade FPS: you center your combat around melee weapons, using ranged weapons only to support you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you want to survive, you must play fast, stay in constant motion, and be aggressive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Melee-Focused Combat</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897080/extras/5d806953503cf74f3f483c294b84f327.poster.avif?t=1771615537\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897080/extras/5d806953503cf74f3f483c294b84f327.webm?t=1771615537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897080/extras/5d806953503cf74f3f483c294b84f327.mp4?t=1771615537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>In Dimenshot, melee combat is at the core of the experience</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong></strong><br><br><br><strong>There are many different melee weapons, each with 3 distinct variants</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong></strong><br><br><br><strong>Ranged weapons play a supporting role; to survive, you must be aggressive and close the distance</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Theme-Based World Structure</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong></strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897080/extras/2ae337bd1c0da5d2292b5cd597a3276e.poster.avif?t=1771615537\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897080/extras/2ae337bd1c0da5d2292b5cd597a3276e.webm?t=1771615537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897080/extras/2ae337bd1c0da5d2292b5cd597a3276e.mp4?t=1771615537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Each of the seven deadly sins is represented by a boss in the game, and each sin has its own unique theme.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Each theme offers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Different environmental designs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Unique enemy models</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Theme-specific enemy behaviors</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Boss fights are designed according to that theme\u2019s combat rhythm and visual identity.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Pure Arena FPS Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897080/extras/dd6506685c7609c6f4b35b57178ed8d3.poster.avif?t=1771615537\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897080/extras/dd6506685c7609c6f4b35b57178ed8d3.webm?t=1771615537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897080/extras/dd6506685c7609c6f4b35b57178ed8d3.mp4?t=1771615537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Enclosed, intense combat areas</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Wave-based enemy system</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Fast, arcade-focused gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A combat system blending melee and ranged weapons</strong><br></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3897080?t=1771615537","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897080/bc085cd683897e22c1d79e6eaadebd4da5f93e03/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771615537","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897080/b0e4fef5cc191646228164a5dc82f84bca7bc4ac/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771615537","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897080/b0e4fef5cc191646228164a5dc82f84bca7bc4ac/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771615537","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Th